  --url "https://example.com" \
  --output ./output \
  --user-agent "Mozilla/5.0..."
```

### Large Pages Timeout

Increase timeout:

```bash
node src/core/screenshot.js \
  --url "https://example.com" \
  --output ./output \
  --timeout 60000
```
